amily=Montserrat:wght@300..800&amp;display=swap\" as=\"style\"/><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\"/><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"/><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>#ErineTheWayfinder | Seitansai Erine 2026 — Cavallery</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Perayaan ulang tahun Catherina Vallencia Kurniawan — #ErineTheWayfinder.\"/><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"Cavallery,Erine JKT48,Catherina Vallencia,JKT48 fanbase\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"#ErineTheWayfinder — Seitansai Erine 2026\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Perayaan ulang tahun Catherina Vallencia Kurniawan oleh CAVALLERY.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"#ErineTheWayfinder — Seitansai Erine 2026\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Perayaan ulang tahun Catherina Vallencia Kurniawan oleh CAVALLERY.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/images/cava-logo-round.png\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/images/cava-logo-round.png\"/><link href=\"https://unpkg.com/boxicons@2.1.4/css/boxicons.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css\"/><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400..900;1,400..900&amp;family=Montserrat:wght@300..800&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/03~yq9q893hmn.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div class=\"knight-watermark\"></div><div class=\"board-watermark\"></div><div class=\"SplashScreen-module__I3M2YW__splash \"><video class=\"SplashScreen-module__I3M2YW__video\" src=\"/assets/keying-logo-center.mp4\" autoPlay=\"\" muted=\"\" playsInline=\"\"></video><button class=\"SplashScreen-module__I3M2YW__skip\">Skip <i class=\"bx bx-chevron-right\"></i></button></div><nav class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__nav  \"><div class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__inner\"><a class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__logo\" href=\"/\"><img src=\"/images/cava-logo.jpg\" alt=\"Cava Logo\" class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__logoImg\"/><div class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__logoInfo\"><span class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__logoText\">Cavallery.id</span><span class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__logoSub\">Fanbase of Catherina Vallencia</span></div></a><ul class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__links\"><li><a class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__link \" href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__dropdownItem\"><button class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__dropdownToggle\">News<i class=\"bx bx-chevron-down\"></i></button></li><li class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__dropdownItem\"><button class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__dropdownToggle\">About<i class=\"bx bx-chevron-down\"></i></button></li><li><a class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__link \" href=\"/schedule\">Schedule</a></li><li><a class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__link \" href=\"/merchandise\">Merchandise</a></li><li class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__dropdownItem\"><button class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__dropdownToggle\">Project<i class=\"bx bx-chevron-down\"></i></button></li><li class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__dropdownItem\"><button class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__dropdownToggle\">Corner<i class=\"bx bx-chevron-down\"></i></button></li><li></li></ul><button class=\"Navbar-module__cJzEcG__burger\" aria-label=\"Toggle menu\"><i class=\"bx bx-menu\"></i></button></div></nav><main><main class=\"page-module__62FGdW__page\"><div class=\"page-module__62FGdW__hero\"><div class=\"page-module__62FGdW__badge\"><svg class=\"page-module__62FGdW__badgeIcon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m12 3-1.9 5.8a2 2 0 0 1-1.3 1.3L3 12l5.8 1.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.3 1.3L12 21l1.9-5.8a2 2 0 0 1 1.3-1.3L21 12l-5.8-1.9a2 2 0 0 1-1.3-1.3L12 3z\"></path></svg><span>Seitansai Project 2026</span></div><h1 class=\"page-module__62FGdW__title\">#ErineTheWayfinder</h1><p class=\"page-module__62FGdW__subtitle\">Perayaan hari ulang tahun Catherina Vallencia Kurniawan. Terima kasih atas dedikasi dan cinta dari seluruh Cavallers!</p><div class=\"page-module__62FGdW__heroActionWrap\"><a class=\"page-module__62FGdW__philosophyBtn\" href=\"/2026/the-wayfinder\"><svg class=\"page-module__62FGdW__btnIcon\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polygon points=\"16.24 7.76 14.12 14.12 7.76 16.24 9.88 9.88 16.24 7.76\"></polygon></svg><span>Lihat Asal-Usul &amp; Filosofi The Wayfinder</span><span class=\"page-module__62FGdW__btnArrow\">→</span></a></div></div><section class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storylineSection\"><div class=\"page-module__62FGdW__sectionHeader\"><span class=\"page-module__62FGdW__sectionTag\"><svg class=\"page-module__62FGdW__tagIcon\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2H20v20H6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1-2.5-2.5Z\"></path><path d=\"M6 6h10\"></path><path d=\"M6 10h10\"></path></svg>Official Storyline</span><h2 class=\"page-module__62FGdW__sectionTitle\">The Wayfinder Journey</h2><p class=\"page-module__62FGdW__sectionDesc\">Kisah perjalanan Erine dalam mencari jejak dan membuka cakrawala baru di luar batas horizon.</p></div><div class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storylineTimeline\"><article class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyCard \"><div class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyImageWrap\"><div></div><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQFkSnFaIAEAEAe?format=jpg&amp;name=4096x4096\" alt=\"The End of The Path\" class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyImage\" loading=\"lazy\"/><div class=\"page-module__62FGdW__imageOverlayBadge\"><svg class=\"page-module__62FGdW__badgeIcon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 2v6\"></path><path d=\"m4.93 10.93 4.24-4.24\"></path><path d=\"m19.07 10.93-4.24-4.24\"></path><path d=\"M2 18h20\"></path><path d=\"M20 22H4\"></path><path d=\"M8 18a4 4 0 0 1 8 0\"></path></svg><span>PROLOG</span></div></div><div class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyContent\"><div class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyBadge\"><svg class=\"page-module__62FGdW__badgeIcon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 2v6\"></path><path d=\"m4.93 10.93 4.24-4.24\"></path><path d=\"m19.07 10.93-4.24-4.24\"></path><path d=\"M2 18h20\"></path><path d=\"M20 22H4\"></path><path d=\"M8 18a4 4 0 0 1 8 0\"></path></svg><span>PROLOG</span></div><h3 class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyTitle\">The End of The Path</h3><blockquote class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyQuote\"><span class=\"page-module__62FGdW__quoteMark\">“</span>Kadang jalan berakhir, untuk membawa kita ke jalan yang baru.<span class=\"page-module__62FGdW__quoteMark\">”</span></blockquote><div class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyParagraphs\"><p>Hari itu, Erine mengikuti seekor kucing.</p><p>Sebuah pertanda membawanya ke tempat yang telah lama terlupakan.</p></div></div></article><article class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyCard page-module__62FGdW__storyCardReverse\"><div class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyImageWrap\"><div></div><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQFkTaHbEAAC1Vs?format=jpg&amp;name=medium\" alt=\"The Forgotten Observatory\" class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyImage\" loading=\"lazy\"/><div class=\"page-module__62FGdW__imageOverlayBadge\"><svg class=\"page-module__62FGdW__badgeIcon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 2v6\"></path><path d=\"m4.93 10.93 4.24-4.24\"></path><path d=\"m19.07 10.93-4.24-4.24\"></path><path d=\"M2 18h20\"></path><path d=\"M20 22H4\"></path><path d=\"M8 18a4 4 0 0 1 8 0\"></path></svg><span>CHAPTER I</span></div></div><div class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyContent\"><div class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyBadge\"><svg class=\"page-module__62FGdW__badgeIcon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 2v6\"></path><path d=\"m4.93 10.93 4.24-4.24\"></path><path d=\"m19.07 10.93-4.24-4.24\"></path><path d=\"M2 18h20\"></path><path d=\"M20 22H4\"></path><path d=\"M8 18a4 4 0 0 1 8 0\"></path></svg><span>CHAPTER I</span></div><h3 class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyTitle\">The Forgotten Observatory</h3><blockquote class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyQuote\"><span class=\"page-module__62FGdW__quoteMark\">“</span>Tempat yang lama ditinggalkan, masih menyimpan cerita.<span class=\"page-module__62FGdW__quoteMark\">”</span></blockquote><div class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyParagraphs\"><p>Di dalam observatorium, Erine menemukan berbagai benda.</p><p>Salah satunya, sebuah jurnal bertuliskan—</p><p>A World Beyond The Horizon.</p></div></div></article><article class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyCard \"><div class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyImageWrap\"><div></div><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQFkUVwbEAAGnUj?format=jpg&amp;name=medium\" alt=\"The Hidden Horizon\" class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyImage\" loading=\"lazy\"/><div class=\"page-module__62FGdW__imageOverlayBadge\"><svg class=\"page-module__62FGdW__badgeIcon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 2v6\"></path><path d=\"m4.93 10.93 4.24-4.24\"></path><path d=\"m19.07 10.93-4.24-4.24\"></path><path d=\"M2 18h20\"></path><path d=\"M20 22H4\"></path><path d=\"M8 18a4 4 0 0 1 8 0\"></path></svg><span>CHAPTER II</span></div></div><div class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyContent\"><div class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyBadge\"><svg class=\"page-module__62FGdW__badgeIcon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 2v6\"></path><path d=\"m4.93 10.93 4.24-4.24\"></path><path d=\"m19.07 10.93-4.24-4.24\"></path><path d=\"M2 18h20\"></path><path d=\"M20 22H4\"></path><path d=\"M8 18a4 4 0 0 1 8 0\"></path></svg><span>CHAPTER II</span></div><h3 class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyTitle\">The Hidden Horizon</h3><blockquote class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyQuote\"><span class=\"page-module__62FGdW__quoteMark\">“</span>Di balik kabut, ada sesuatu yang menunggu.<span class=\"page-module__62FGdW__quoteMark\">”</span></blockquote><div class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyParagraphs\"><p>Erine melihat sebuah kapal di kejauhan, perlahan muncul dari balik kabut.</p><p>Apa yang ada di balik sana?</p></div></div></article><article class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyCard page-module__62FGdW__storyCardReverse\"><div class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyImageWrap\"><div></div><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQJitRqbAAAq2cT?format=jpg&amp;name=medium\" alt=\"The Legacy\" class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyImage\" loading=\"lazy\"/><div class=\"page-module__62FGdW__imageOverlayBadge\"><svg class=\"page-module__62FGdW__badgeIcon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 2v6\"></path><path d=\"m4.93 10.93 4.24-4.24\"></path><path d=\"m19.07 10.93-4.24-4.24\"></path><path d=\"M2 18h20\"></path><path d=\"M20 22H4\"></path><path d=\"M8 18a4 4 0 0 1 8 0\"></path></svg><span>CHAPTER III</span></div></div><div class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyContent\"><div class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyBadge\"><svg class=\"page-module__62FGdW__badgeIcon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 2v6\"></path><path d=\"m4.93 10.93 4.24-4.24\"></path><path d=\"m19.07 10.93-4.24-4.24\"></path><path d=\"M2 18h20\"></path><path d=\"M20 22H4\"></path><path d=\"M8 18a4 4 0 0 1 8 0\"></path></svg><span>CHAPTER III</span></div><h3 class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyTitle\">The Legacy</h3><blockquote class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyQuote\"><span class=\"page-module__62FGdW__quoteMark\">“</span>Membayangkan apa yang menunggu di balik tembok, menjadi kekuatan &#x27;tuk mau mencoba.<span class=\"page-module__62FGdW__quoteMark\">”</span></blockquote><div class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyParagraphs\"><p>Erine melangkah lebih jauh, melewati kabut dan awan.</p><p>Di hadapannya, pulau-pulau terapung terlihat.</p><p>Kini, ia memilih mengejar horizon.</p></div></div></article><article class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyCard \"><div class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyImageWrap\"><div></div><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQJjBEpbsAAHhUU?format=jpg&amp;name=medium\" alt=\"Captain&#x27;s Log\" class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyImage\" loading=\"lazy\"/><div class=\"page-module__62FGdW__imageOverlayBadge\"><svg class=\"page-module__62FGdW__badgeIcon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 2v6\"></path><path d=\"m4.93 10.93 4.24-4.24\"></path><path d=\"m19.07 10.93-4.24-4.24\"></path><path d=\"M2 18h20\"></path><path d=\"M20 22H4\"></path><path d=\"M8 18a4 4 0 0 1 8 0\"></path></svg><span>EPILOGUE</span></div></div><div class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyContent\"><div class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyBadge\"><svg class=\"page-module__62FGdW__badgeIcon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 2v6\"></path><path d=\"m4.93 10.93 4.24-4.24\"></path><path d=\"m19.07 10.93-4.24-4.24\"></path><path d=\"M2 18h20\"></path><path d=\"M20 22H4\"></path><path d=\"M8 18a4 4 0 0 1 8 0\"></path></svg><span>EPILOGUE</span></div><h3 class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyTitle\">Captain&#x27;s Log</h3><blockquote class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyQuote\"><span class=\"page-module__62FGdW__quoteMark\">“</span>Life is short, the world is wide. I want to make some memories.<span class=\"page-module__62FGdW__quoteMark\">”</span></blockquote><div class=\"page-module__62FGdW__storyParagraphs\"><p>Captain&#x27;s Log — Day One.</p><p>Erine akhirnya memulai perjalanan menuju dunia yang belum pernah ia kenal.</p><p>Dan untuk pertama kalinya, halaman itu menjadi miliknya untuk ditulis.</p></div></div></article></div></section><section class=\"page-module__62FGdW__gifterSection\"><div class=\"page-module__62FGdW__sectionHeader\"><span class=\"page-module__62FGdW__sectionTag\"><svg class=\"page-module__62FGdW__tagIcon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 9H4.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5H6\"></path><path d=\"M18 9h1.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 0-5H18\"></path><path d=\"M4 22h16\"></path><path d=\"M10 14.66V17c0 .55-.45 1-1 1H8c-.55 0-1 .45-1 1v1c0 .55.45 1 1 1h8c.55 0 1-.45 1-1v-1c0-.55-.45-1-1-1h-1c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1v-2.34\"></path><path d=\"M18 4H6v7a6 6 0 0 0 12 0V4Z\"></path></svg>Special Appreciation</span><h2 class=\"page-module__62FGdW__sectionTitle\">Top Gifter #ErineTheWayfinder</h2><p class=\"page-module__62FGdW__sectionDesc\">Apresiasi dan terima kasih setinggi-tingginya kepada para Top Gifter atas kontribusi luar biasa untuk menyukseskan Seitansai Project Erine 2026.</p></div><div class=\"pag